#: synpkg.qml:1990
msgid ""
"Packages here are recipes, not binaries. Installing one opens a terminal, "
"shows you its PKGBUILD, and builds it."
msgstr "Aquí los paquetes son recetas, no binarios. Instalar uno abre una terminal, te muestra su PKGBUILD y lo compila."

